0.06 0.17 0.36 rg 0.06 0.17 0.36 RG 0.00 803.89 595.28 38.00 re f
BT 1 1 1 rg /F2 9 Tf 48.00 817.89 Td (HealthGuard AI - Senior Software Engineer / GenAI Interview Guide) Tj ET
BT 0.25 0.29 0.36 rg /F1 8 Tf 48.00 28.00 Td (Healthcare GenAI | RAG | Voice Assistant | Patient Safety Chatbot) Tj ET
BT 0.25 0.29 0.36 rg /F1 8 Tf 502.28 28.00 Td (Page 8) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 777.89 Td (16. Prompt engineering vs fine-tuning?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 764.89 Td (Prompting changes instructions; fine-tuning trains behavior. RAG supplies dynamic knowledge.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 747.89 Td (17. How CI/CD works for GenAI?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 734.89 Td (Run unit tests, integration tests, RAG evals, prompt regressions, security scans, Docker build, deploy, and) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 722.89 Td (rollback.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 705.89 Td (18. How do you secure PHI?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 692.89 Td (Use auth, RBAC, owner filters, masked logs, secret management, HTTPS, and audit logs.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 675.89 Td (19. How do you handle LLM failure?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 662.89 Td (Fail closed for reports and use rules-based fallback for safe chat when possible.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 645.89 Td (20. What is fail-closed behavior?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 632.89 Td (Stop a risky operation instead of saving or returning incomplete unsafe output.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 615.89 Td (21. How do you reduce cost?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 602.89 Td (Short prompts, smaller classifiers, top_k tuning, caching, token limits, and avoiding unnecessary LLM calls.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 585.89 Td (22. How do you improve performance?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 572.89 Td (Batch embeddings, cache metadata, tune chunks, use workers, stream responses, and reduce tokens.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 555.89 Td (23. Why FastAPI?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 542.89 Td (It provides typed APIs, validation, OpenAPI docs, async readiness, and clean Python service structure.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 525.89 Td (24. Why Pydantic?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 512.89 Td (It validates data contracts and prevents malformed health data from entering service logic.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 495.89 Td (25. Why layered architecture?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 482.89 Td (It separates routes, schemas, services, storage, RAG, LLM, and security for testability.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 465.89 Td (26. What is the NLP layer?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 452.89 Td (It extracts intent, symptoms, duration, severity, age, medicines, allergies, conditions, and missing fields.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 435.89 Td (27. What intents are detected?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 422.89 Td (Symptom guidance, medicine question, lab report question, diet question, emergency symptom, and info request.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 405.89 Td (28. How are red flags detected?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 392.89 Td (Rules detect chest pain, breathing trouble, bleeding, confusion, fainting, and severe weakness.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 375.89 Td (29. Why no repeated disclaimer?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 362.89 Td (Repeated disclaimers hurt UX; safety appears when risk requires it and static guidance covers general limits.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 345.89 Td (30. How do you refuse medication?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 332.89 Td (The bot says it cannot recommend medication/dosage and asks for context or clinician review.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 315.89 Td (31. How do you handle dosage questions?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 302.89 Td (Dosage is refused because it needs clinician judgment and patient-specific context.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 285.89 Td (32. What is user-specific memory?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 272.89 Td (Recent messages from the current user_id and conversation_id only.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 255.89 Td (33. How was the memory bug fixed?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 242.89 Td (Current user message is saved first, latest rows are fetched DESC, and rows are reversed before prompt use.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 225.89 Td (34. How do you prevent old chats mixing?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 212.89 Td (Backend filters by conversation_id and frontend stores active conversation keys per user.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 195.89 Td (35. Can doctors see patient chats?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 182.89 Td (Not by default. Doctor workflow focuses on reviewable reports, not private chat memory.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 165.89 Td (36. What documents can users upload?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 152.89 Td (Lab reports, prescriptions, discharge summaries, scan notes, doctor notes, vitals, and allergy records.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 135.89 Td (37. What documents should not be uploaded?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 122.89 Td (IDs, bank files, resumes, unrelated photos, or non-health files.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 105.89 Td (38. How do you validate uploads?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 92.89 Td (Size/type checks, malware pattern scan, extraction checks, and audit logging.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
