0.06 0.17 0.36 rg 0.06 0.17 0.36 RG 0.00 803.89 595.28 38.00 re f
BT 1 1 1 rg /F2 9 Tf 48.00 817.89 Td (HealthGuard AI - Senior Software Engineer / GenAI Interview Guide) Tj ET
BT 0.25 0.29 0.36 rg /F1 8 Tf 48.00 28.00 Td (Healthcare GenAI | RAG | Voice Assistant | Patient Safety Chatbot) Tj ET
BT 0.25 0.29 0.36 rg /F1 8 Tf 502.28 28.00 Td (Page 9) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 777.89 Td (39. How are documents indexed?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 764.89 Td (Extract text, clean, chunk, embed, store metadata, and link chunks to user_id.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 747.89 Td (40. What is metadata filtering?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 734.89 Td (Filtering retrieval by user_id, source type, document ID, category, and ownership.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 717.89 Td (41. Why citations?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 704.89 Td (They make answers auditable and reduce unsupported claims.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 687.89 Td (42. How choose chunk size?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 674.89 Td (Balance semantic completeness, retrieval precision, and token cost.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 657.89 Td (43. What is overlap?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 644.89 Td (Shared text between chunks to preserve context at boundaries.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 627.89 Td (44. What is reranking?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 614.89 Td (A second ranking step to reorder retrieved chunks by final relevance.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 597.89 Td (45. How handle poor retrieval?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 584.89 Td (Ask clarification, lower confidence, avoid pretending context exists, and cite only real sources.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 567.89 Td (46. What does a report include?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 554.89 Td (Risk summary, precautions, diet, wellness plan, doctor questions, reminders, and sources.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 537.89 Td (47. Why mandatory fields?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 524.89 Td (Reports require enough structured data to avoid unsafe generic output.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 507.89 Td (48. Why consent validation?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 494.89 Td (Health data processing must be explicit and auditable.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 477.89 Td (49. What is triage?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 464.89 Td (Rule-based urgent symptom and risk detection before LLM/report generation.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 447.89 Td (50. What is risk scoring?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 434.89 Td (Deterministic scoring across symptoms, lifestyle, conditions, sleep, diet, and red flags.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 417.89 Td (51. How do you handle PDF generation?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 404.89 Td (The report/PDF layer formats structured report data into a doctor-ready document with sections, sources,) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 392.89 Td (review metadata, and page numbers.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 375.89 Td (52. How do you handle doctor review?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 362.89 Td (Doctors review submitted reports, add status, notes, priority, signature, and follow-up guidance without) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 350.89 Td (bypassing patient ownership controls.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 333.89 Td (53. How do you handle admin knowledge?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 320.89 Td (Admins upload trusted knowledge with category and citation metadata so RAG can retrieve approved context.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 303.89 Td (54. How do you handle compliance role?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 290.89 Td (Compliance users inspect audit logs, privacy controls, security status, and operational evidence.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 273.89 Td (55. How do you handle email verification?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 260.89 Td (Registration creates an OTP; the account stays restricted until the email is verified.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 243.89 Td (56. How do you handle Google SSO?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 230.89 Td (The app has provider start/callback scaffolding so production identity can integrate without changing business) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 218.89 Td (flows.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 201.89 Td (57. How do you handle backend route protection?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 188.89 Td (Every protected API validates the token, role, and ownership. Frontend hiding is never trusted.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 171.89 Td (58. How do you handle sessions?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 158.89 Td (Sessions or tokens identify verified users and are checked on each protected request.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 141.89 Td (59. How do you handle CSRF?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 128.89 Td (Cookie-authenticated writes should require a CSRF token so other sites cannot submit actions as the user.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 111.89 Td (60. How do you handle secret management?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 98.89 Td (Local .env is for demo only. Production should use a cloud secret manager or vault.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
