0.06 0.17 0.36 rg 0.06 0.17 0.36 RG 0.00 803.89 595.28 38.00 re f
BT 1 1 1 rg /F2 9 Tf 48.00 817.89 Td (HealthGuard AI - Senior Software Engineer / GenAI Interview Guide) Tj ET
BT 0.25 0.29 0.36 rg /F1 8 Tf 48.00 28.00 Td (Healthcare GenAI | RAG | Voice Assistant | Patient Safety Chatbot) Tj ET
BT 0.25 0.29 0.36 rg /F1 8 Tf 502.28 28.00 Td (Page 10) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 777.89 Td (61. How do you handle SPF?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 764.89 Td (SPF authorizes which mail servers can send email for the domain.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 747.89 Td (62. How do you handle DKIM?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 734.89 Td (DKIM signs email so receivers can verify it came from an authorized domain sender.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 717.89 Td (63. How do you handle DMARC?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 704.89 Td (DMARC tells receivers what to do when SPF or DKIM fails and improves email trust.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 687.89 Td (64. How do you handle no personal Gmail?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 674.89 Td (Production should use a domain no-reply sender with SPF, DKIM, DMARC, auditability, and deliverability.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 657.89 Td (65. How do you handle PHI masking?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 644.89 Td (Logs should avoid raw health text and store IDs, hashes, event types, and limited metadata.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 627.89 Td (66. How do you handle audit logging?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 614.89 Td (Important actions such as login, upload, report generation, review, and deletion are recorded.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 597.89 Td (67. How do you handle privacy export?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 584.89 Td (Users can export their stored reports, chats, consents, and related health data.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 567.89 Td (68. How do you handle delete health data?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 554.89 Td (A confirmation flow deletes user-owned reports, chats, documents, and profiles.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 537.89 Td (69. How do you handle voice silence detection?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 524.89 Td (A timer resets when speech arrives and auto-stops after five seconds of silence.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 507.89 Td (70. How do you handle interim transcripts?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 494.89 Td (Interim results make speech capture feel live and prevent losing partial phrases.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 477.89 Td (71. How do you handle manual stop?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 464.89 Td (Manual Stop lets the user finish immediately without waiting for silence detection.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 447.89 Td (72. How do you handle voice assessment separation?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 434.89 Td (Voice questions go to lightweight chatbot mode unless the user explicitly starts assessment/report generation.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 417.89 Td (73. How do you handle voice follow-ups?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 404.89 Td (The bot asks one short question at a time and limits follow-ups to a few useful details.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 387.89 Td (74. How do you handle voice summary?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 374.89 Td (After enough details, the bot summarizes symptoms and gives precautions, diet, hydration, rest, and doctor-) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 362.89 Td (prep notes.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 345.89 Td (75. How do you handle safe wording?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 332.89 Td (The assistant uses calm wording such as consult a clinician or seek urgent care for specific red flags.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 315.89 Td (76. How do you handle allergy extraction?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 302.89 Td (The NLP layer scans allergy/allergic phrases and stores mentioned allergy context.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 285.89 Td (77. How do you handle age extraction?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 272.89 Td (The NLP layer detects phrases such as age is, I am, or I'm followed by a number.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 255.89 Td (78. How do you handle severity extraction?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 242.89 Td (Severity can be mild/moderate/severe, a 1-10 score, or a high temperature value.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 225.89 Td (79. How do you handle duration extraction?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 212.89 Td (Duration is extracted from phrases like for two days, since yesterday, today, or for 3 hours.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 195.89 Td (80. How do you handle medicine extraction?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 182.89 Td (Medicine intent is detected from medicine, medication, tablet, antibiotic, can I take, and similar wording.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 165.89 Td (81. How do you handle condition extraction?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 152.89 Td (Conditions such as diabetes, BP, asthma, thyroid, cholesterol, kidney, and heart disease are recognized.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 135.89 Td (82. How do you handle follow-up selection?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 122.89 Td (Missing required fields for the detected intent decide the next single follow-up question.) Tj ET
BT 0.06 0.17 0.36 rg /F2 9.4 Tf 48.00 105.89 Td (83. How do you handle default answer style?) Tj ET
BT 0.07 0.09 0.13 rg /F1 9.0 Tf 48.00 92.89 Td (The chatbot defaults to 1-3 short lines and avoids long paragraphs unless requested.) Tj ET
